  "/cdm-practical/meta_description": "How to get from Bordeaux Airport (Mérignac) to Gare Saint-Jean station and nearby hotels: Tram Line F or the 30'Direct airport bus, with times, costs, and bike rules.",
  "/cdm-practical/meta_title": "Bordeaux Airport to Gare Saint-Jean: tram or airport bus",
  "/cdm-practical/q1_bus": "Direct coach shuttle from Bordeaux Airport to Gare Saint-Jean. No intermediate stops, no transfers.",
  "/cdm-practical/q1_title": "What is it?",
  "/cdm-practical/q1_tram": "Direct tram connection from Bordeaux Airport (Mérignac) to Gare Saint-Jean (main train station). Launched Dec 6, 2025.",
  "/cdm-practical/q2_bus": "Limited: 07:30–20:05 daily. Mon–Fri: ~22 runs. Sat/Sun: ~14 runs. Not available early morning or late evening.",
  "/cdm-practical/q2_title": "How often does it run?",
  "/cdm-practical/q2_tram": "Every 10 min (Mon–Sat) / Every 15 min (Sun/holidays). First: ~5am. Last: Midnight (Mon–Wed), 1am (Thu–Sat)",
  "/cdm-practical/q3_bus": "~30 minutes (traffic dependent)",
  "/cdm-practical/q3_title": "How long does it take?",
  "/cdm-practical/q3_tram": "~45 minutes. Direct, no transfers.",
  "/cdm-practical/q4_bus": "€9 online / €10 on board",
  "/cdm-practical/q4_title": "How much does it cost?",
  "/cdm-practical/q4_tram": "€1.90 per ticket",
  "/cdm-practical/q5_bus": "✅ Bikes in cases: Yes\n✅ Bikes not in cases: Yes\nRequirement: Closed bag, labeled with name, phone, address.\nCarrier may refuse oversized items.\nBikes not in cases = anytime transport (no restrictions).\n30'Direct FAQ: 30direct.com",
  "/cdm-practical/q5_title": "What about my bike?",
  "/cdm-practical/q5_tram": "✅ Bikes in cases: Always\n✅ Bikes not in cases: 9am–4pm only\n❌ NOT 7am–9am or 4pm–7pm\nPack in case to avoid rush hours.\nTBM Bicycle Rules: 05 57 57 88 88",
  "/cdm-practical/q6_bus": "Book online at 30direct.com or pay €10 on board. Book in advance for €9 rate.\n\nTo board: Show your ticket to the driver (printed, phone e-ticket, or mobile). Tickets can be purchased directly from the driver. Visa/Mastercard accepted onboard (American Express not accepted).",
  "/cdm-practical/q6_title": "How do I book?",
  "/cdm-practical/q6_tram": "No booking required. Buy ticket at tram stop (vending machine), TBM mobile app (Bordeaux transit app), or Relay newsstand at airport.\n\nTo board: Validate your ticket on the platform or onboard validators (card readers, white validators, or TBM app via Bluetooth). Self-validate and board—no ticket inspection.",
